# Thieves Guild: Gentleman Jim Stacey's last job, Sjoring Hard-Heart (Vivec Guild of Fighters, 056049A0), then his
# final "jobs" line raises the player to Master Thief (rank 9). Last in the folder: staceyScript disables Stacey at
# the next cell change once TG_KillHardHeart is 100.
# The kill stands in for the fight.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance --instance 2 mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_a1_11_report --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case tg_hard_heart
run
player->PositionCell 6452 -800 -244 0 "Vivec, Simine Fralinie: Bookseller"
until 300 GetPCCell "Vivec, Simine Fralinie: Bookseller" == 1
approach 05D48791
talk stacey
ask jobs
ask Sjoring Hard-Heart
expect GetJournalIndex TG_KillHardHeart == 10
bye
run
player->PositionCell -913 -200 -499 0 "Vivec, Guild of Fighters"
until 300 GetPCCell "Vivec, Guild of Fighters" == 1
approach 056049A0
defend
console 056049A0.kill
until 600 GetDeadCount "sjoring hard-heart" >= 1
run
player->PositionCell 6452 -800 -244 0 "Vivec, Simine Fralinie: Bookseller"
until 300 GetPCCell "Vivec, Simine Fralinie: Bookseller" == 1
approach 05D48791
talk stacey
ask Sjoring Hard-Heart
expect GetJournalIndex TG_KillHardHeart == 100
ask jobs
expect player->GetPCRank "Thieves Guild" == 9
bye
end
